# Phase 11: signals: handlers that return to the interrupted code with every
# register intact, EINTR, default actions, SIGKILL, faults as signals,
# SIGCHLD, and who may signal whom.
cerberus kernel shell
!send run /bin/sigtest
!wait 30
a handler ran and returned
a computation interrupted by handlers gave the same result
a sleep of 5 s was interrupted by a signal and returned EINTR
SIGTERM ended a process, was ignored on request; SIGKILL cannot be ignored
a SIGSEGV handler caught a bad pointer
SIGCHLD arrived when a child exited
uid 1000 could not signal a root process
SIGTERM ended a process with four sleeping threads
sigtest: PASS
run: /bin/sigtest exited with status 0
